        "fields": {
            "answer": 21828,
            "candidate": 201,
            "answer_feedback": "When it’s all said and done, turnout sits at a miserable 42% and the public have voted 67/32 to keep FPTP, the two-party grip remains strong and you’ve just gambled away most of your political capital, disappointment doesn’t even begin to describe this result."
